				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "35fb14fa-d7ea-4317-a70a-ec9b52ac6424")
	)
	(text "PRIMARY  —  PoE input, floating 37-57 V (no reference to GND)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "51024812-c360-4bf8-b8eb-2b8f914b4a91")
	)
	(text "2x Comchip CDBHM1100L-HF Schottky bridge (100 V / 1 A, MBS / TO-269AA) replaces 8x B1100.\nPins per KiCad TO-269AA (1,2 = ~, 3 = +, 4 = -): confirm +/- corner vs Comchip datasheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "66b25534-1df0-488d-b56e-dc6780f43a2a")
	)
	(text "CMC PE-53913NLT (6 mH, 1 A): Murata MYBSP EMC test filter. Replaces R7/R8 0R.\nD1 SMAJ58A sits at the module pins, after the CMC. Vbr min 64.4 V > MYBSP abs-max 60 V:\nit limits surge energy but cannot keep the module below 60 V. Port-side surge (GDT/shield) on RJ45 sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7ae22ed6-a061-4e3f-94b2-e7f2bd8dfe81")
	)
	(text "U8 TVS0701: +/-7 V standoff, 11 V clamp @ 30 A, same DRB footprint as the old TVS1401.\nFL1 ACM4520-231: 3.0 A @ 60 C (old -901 was 2.3 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "97d526c4-f5b7-4a00-ae2a-db50aed05864")
	)
	(text "+3V3: TLV62130A 5 V -> 3.3 V / 3 A, enabled by SOM SYS_PG."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "996d2ac4-e5ae-48fd-9a0d-1e6d86cb24c3")
	)
	(text "M4: NO capacitor between +VIN and -VIN (IEEE 802.3at inrush).\nModule has no OVP / no OTP -> output OVP done by the TPS2121 mux."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d9e34980-c575-44c7-956a-f8daa25bd77f")
	)
	(text "Adapter ORing (Murata typ. circuit): USB present -> U14 pulls DEN\nto -VIN -> MYBSP off. R21 680R, R22 3.3k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 109.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e25aa84d-d85d-47b8-ae08-522fe68a7839")
	)
	(text "TPS2121 mux: IN1 = USB_5V (priority, PR1 > 4.25 V), IN2 = PoE (VCCIN).\nOVP ~5.75 V on both inputs (44.2k/10k), ILIM 22.1k ~ 4.5 A, ST/CP2 -> GND.\nReplaces Q1-Q4 discrete ideal diodes (DMG2305UX SOT-23 was under-rated for 5 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f1be1762-3ed8-4623-ab64-1e61e20d0ec3")
	)
